# Python / FastAPI Rules

- Preserve FastAPI `/v1` endpoint contracts unless an approved API spec says otherwise.
- Keep functions focused and deterministic where possible.
- Use explicit types for public functions and Pydantic models for API contracts.
- Validate untrusted identifiers before file-system access.
- Do not add network calls or cloud dependencies; this training repo must remain offline-friendly.
- Add tests for success, boundary, malformed-input, and regression cases relevant to the requirement.
- Existing brownfield tests may document defects; do not blindly encode them as desired behavior.
